    "published": "2025-05-29",
    "publication": "WISE 2026 Special Track on Innovative Web Technologies / arXiv:2505.23022v2",
    "publication_type": "査読済み国際会議採録論文・プレプリント",
    "publication_status": "Accepted at WISE 2026 after peer review; arXiv v2 (2026-08-26), not yet Version of Record; Springer LNCS forthcoming",
    "lineage": "llm-serving-scheduling-disaggregation",
    "topics": [
